<title>SWEDEN: Esselte says sells Long Island offices.</title>
<headline>Esselte says sells Long Island offices.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish office equipment group Esselte said on Monday it had sold its property in the Garden City development on Long Island in New York for 65 million crowns.</p>
<p>The sale of the property, which housed Esselte's U.S. headquarters, resulted in a capital gain of three billion crowns, Esselte said in a statement. Esselte said it would remain in the building in leased premises.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
